  "description": "After being rescued by the young lady of the house, Rose has felt indebted to Alice. Unfortunately, fate would keep them separate as Alice is sent to the Grand Duke's estate for an arranged marriage. Years later, the time has finally come for the two to reunite. Rose would be foolish, however, to assume the same young lady awaits her. \n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Gyeryak Danpyeonseon (계략 단편선) Collection.*",
